# What the installed cmux-next checks copy (cmux-next-checks) is made from, one repository path per line.
# A path ending in "/" is a folder: its own files and its lint/ and arch_rules/ files land at the copy's root.
# Any other path is one file, copied beside the checks under its own name (when the commit has it);
# `source -> destination` copies it under another name (a folder: under that folder of the copy).
# refresh_checks.py (copy_pairs) turns these into the (source, destination) pairs that install-git-hooks.sh and a
# pre-push refresh both copy, and each stamps the copy (.source) from the pairs it copied and records them (.pairs).
# post-merge refuses a checkout where any source differs from the trusted branch. A checker that loads a file from
# beside itself adds that file here, and nowhere else.
scripts/cmux-next/
# check-package-dependency-lists.py imports the Swift source masker.
scripts/swift_source_mask.py
# check-single-host-fallbacks.py reads runs-on through the shared workflow resolver.
tests/workflow_jobs.py
# The gate loads its lint-tool release download fallback from beside itself (refresh_checks.py ENTRY_POINTS).
scripts/ci/github_release_download.py
